165
00:07:36.570 --> 00:07:38.763
An dif I go to this other IP address,

166
00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.750
I also have only EU-West-1.

167
00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.520
So the reason is because I'm redirected

168
00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.120
to the one that's closest to me,

169
00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.960
but I have a VPN just to show you.

170
00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.640
So I can connect into the United States

171
00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:53.073
to be closer to the US itself,

172
00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:56.040
and then go here and refresh

173
00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.660
and now I'm connected to US-East-1.

174
00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.780
So, here, both of them are US-East-1.

175
00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.640
So this shows you that the Global Accelerator

176
00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:04.620
is working as intended.

177
00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.200
For this part of the demo you would need to have a VPN,

178
00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.130
